OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSASteam engine trips suspended after
OL,4,Atwo fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,7,Fthe first fire spanned a grassland area
OL,8,Fof roughly 100m by five metres, while
OL,9,Fthe second fire - involving vegetation
OL,10,Fat the side of railway track - was
OL,11,Ffound to have likely been caused by
OL,12,Fsparks from the passing train.
OL,14,FPeak Rail, which run services on the
OL,15,FMidland Railway line, said the
OL,16,Fwithdrawal of steam-hauled trains would
OL,17,Fcontinue "until further notice".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
